OL,3,GNEWSAWoman on train slapped
OL,4,Asix-year-old boy she didn't know across
OL,5,Athe face
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are searching for a woman who
OL,8,Fslapped a six-year-old boy across the
OL,9,Fface on board a train in Edinburgh.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at about 15:00 on
OL,12,FSaturday on a rail service that had
OL,13,Ftravelled from Morpeth, Northumberland,
OL,14,Fand had just arrived at Edinburgh
OL,15,FWaverley - its final stop.
OL,17,FThe boy - who the woman did not know -
OL,18,Fwas with a relative at the time and
OL,19,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said the
OL,20,Fassault was witnessed by several
OL,21,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
